    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="10" para="true">CAPUT X.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1" caput="10">De Occultis stellarũ qualitatibus.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>I.</i> PRater eas qualitates manifestas,</l>
    <l n="4">stellis etiam conveniunt varia qua-</l>
    <l n="5">litates occulta, secundum quas variis mo-</l>
    <l n="6">dis in inferiora influunt, unde occultarum</l>
    <l n="7">influentiarum patet ratio.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">§. 1. <i>Vtrum dentur occulta influentia</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>siderum</i>, non est necessum ut inquira-</l>
    <l n="10">mus, nam &amp; vulgo jam notatum est,</l>
    <l n="11">ratione <i>συμπαθείας</i> &amp; <i>ἀντιπαθείας</i> tam</l>
    <l n="12">multa in inferioribus adverti operatio-</l>
    <l n="13">num exempla, ut negari non possint.</l>
    <l n="14">Vulgatum illud est ad Septentrionem</l>
    <l n="15">dirigi Magneticam acum, virtute Lunæ</l>
    <l n="16">mare variis motibus agitari, aliquas</l>
    <l n="17">plantas pandere sese &amp; claudere secun-</l>
    <l n="18">dum motum Solis, aliquas ad motum</l>
    <l n="19">Solis sese convertere, aliquas emergere</l>
    <l n="20">ex aqua, &amp; infra eam occultari siderum</l>
    <l n="21">vario influxu; Imo circa animalia &amp;</l>
    <l n="22">homines non pauciora observes.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">§. 2. Proinde id solum quærendum</l>
    <l n="24">est, <i>unde pendeant occulta influentia?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>quousque se vires illarum protendant? &amp;</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>quomodo debeant dividi?</i> Nam specia-</l>
    <l n="27">iior illarum explicatio ad historiam A-</l>
    <l n="28">strorum</l>
  </main_text>
